sing the reflections and subsurface scattering quality in the project settings, but the distortion is still present.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nOpen MRP.\n\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[bug.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21186967/bug.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108525/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108525/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}